  "bodyText": "Project Lifecycle Platform\n\nRFI-A-06c-BL22-CIV-679\n\nv1\n\nInspection Checklist\n\n(* Required fields)\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\nC.I.\n\nCISLwttUser60\n\n›\n\nE.E.\n\nEESLzntUser60\n\n›\n\nQ.I.\n\nQISLeubUser60\n\nCreated at\n\n01 Sept 2:08 AM\n\n9 hours ago\n\nLast updated on\n\n01 Sept 2:09 AM\n\n9 hours ago\n\nChecklist questions\n\n1. Bench Mark / GPS Co-ordinates / Reference Point Co-ordinates *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 1\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n2. Marking of Pile ( Northing & Easting ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 2\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n3. Diameter of Pile ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 3\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n4. Depth of Bore ( form NGL) - (MM) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 4\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n5. Template Fixing / Position *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 5\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n6. Pile Distance ( P1 to P2 ) - ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 6\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n7. Pile Distance ( Row to Row ) - ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 7\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n8. Top level Height Variation ( Within Table ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 8\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n9. Column Post Tilt / Plumb *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 9\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n10. Clear Cover ( MM ) preferable pile stub should centre of bore *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 10\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n11. Grade of Concrete *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 11\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n12. Concrete Quantity ( Cum) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 12\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n13. Slump requirement at pouring stage *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 13\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n14. Mode of Concrete Placing *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 14\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n15. Concrete Compaction *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 15\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n16. Cube Sampling / No of Cube required for casting *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\n\nOK - as per standard (solar smoke) 16\n\nSelect Inspection Status\n\nOk\nNot Ok\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\nClose\nSubmit"
